work through which patients access network-wide services in a digitally ena=
bled system. Pillars to this front door include navigation, triage, increas=
ed electronic health record (EHR) functionality, shared care records with i=
nteroperability, a skilled workforce, key stakeholder engagement and digita=
l inclusion. Out of hospital care has become an integrated community of hea=
